# Meta Ads (Cursor)

**Authority:** `docs/adr/ADR-024-meta-ads-approval-gate.md` · `docs/meta-ads.md` · COS `008_GROWTH_PLAYBOOK.md`

## What agents may do

- Draft campaign JSON matching `docs/meta-ads/examples/se-traffic-register.js`
- Validate with `npm run meta-ads:propose -- <file.json>`
- Import via admin or `--submit` (inserts `pending_approval` / draft in DB)

## What agents must not do

- Call Meta Marketing API or Graph ad endpoints
- Auto-approve, raise budget caps, or spend
- Use fear-based NPF copy, medical claims, or fake urgency
- Point destination URLs outside mystarday.se / .eu / .app <!-- pragma: allowlist secret -->

Approve happens only in `/admin#meta-annonser` by a human admin.
